h:\n- `registerPlugin(plugin: Plugin)`: Adds plugin to execution queue\n- `registerTemplate(template: Template)`: Registers named templates\n- `resolvePluginOrder()`: Topological sort of plugins by dependencies (detects circular/missing deps)\n- `build(files: ContentFile[])`: Executes full build pipeline:\n  1. Calls `beforeBuild` hooks in dependency order\n  2. Calls `transformContent` hooks on each file in dependency order\n  3. Renders templates\n  4. Calls `afterBuild` hooks in dependency order\n  5. Returns populated BuildContext\n- `getPlugins()`, `getTemplates()`: Accessors\n\n**src/core/templates.ts** - Two built-in templates:\n- `createDefaultTemplate()`: Article template with title, date, and content\n- `createListTemplate()`: List-style template with title and list container\n\n### **3. Test Files (tests/)**\n\n**tests/core.test.ts** - 15 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Plugin registration\n- Template registration\n- Default and list template rendering\n- Raw content output when no template\n- beforeBuild, transformContent, afterBuild hooks\n- Plugin dependency resolution (topological sort)\n- Circular dependency detection\n- Missing dependency detection\n- Multiple plugins transforming in order\n- Shared data store\n- File metadata retention\n- Empty file list handling\n\n**tests/plugins/taxonomy.test.ts** - 9 tests for taxonomy plugin:\n- Tag index building from file tags\n- Tag listing page generation\n- Files with no tags\n- Multiple tags per file\n- Tag pages listing all files\n- Tag map storage in ctx.data\n- Empty file list handling\n- Case normalization (tags to lowercase)\n\n**tests/plugins/asset-pipeline.test.ts** - 7 tests:\n- Relative image URL rewriting to /assets/\n- Relative link URL rewriting to /assets/\n- Absolute URLs left unchanged\n- Asset manifest generation in ctx.data\n- Files with no asset references\n- Multiple assets per file\n- No double-processing of already-rewritten URLs\n\n**tests/plugins/sitemap.test.ts** - 8 tests:\n- Si